Three offers are available:

Essential Pack:
- Complete study of 2026 edition in secured PDF format;
- Consolidated and individual analysis of 21 banks;
- Rankings and benchmarks by indicator;
- ABIX Data Explorer 2025 license included for 12 months;
- 1 user.

Pro Pack:
- All Essential Pack features;
- Structured Excel file containing the data;
- ABIX Data Explorer license (2024 and 2025 data) for 12 months;
- Period-over-period trend analysis and interactive visualizations;
- Data and analysis exports;
- Up to 3 users belonging to the same entity.

Corporate Executive Pack:
- All Pro Pack features;
- ABIX Data Explorer Executive license (historical data 2022, 2023, 2024 and 2025);
- Multidimensional analysis & 360° bank profiles;
- Executive Dashboard & Key Insights;
- Peer groups & advanced benchmarks;
- Executive PDF reports & Excel exports;
- Up to 20 users belonging to the same entity.
